{"id":"218e46cd4acfa714","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nth-from-end-nfa.md","title":"倒数第 n 位为 1 的小 NFA","display":"df-nth-from-end-nfa — 倒数第 n 位为 1 的小 NFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa","aliases":["73-df-nth-from-end-nfa"],"display":"df-nth-from-end-nfa — 倒数第 n 位为 1 的小 NFA","depends_on":["[[73-df-nfa-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.3.6, print pp. 63–65; PDF pp. 85–87; parameterized witness","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nth-from-end-nfa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nth-from-end-nfa — 倒数第 n 位为 1 的小 NFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5abb4703af79a510\" href=\"?note=5abb4703af79a510\" title=\"73-df-nfa-structure\">73-df-nfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.3.6, print pp. 63–65; PDF pp. 85–87; parameterized witness"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_n(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\},&amp;q=0\\land a=0,\\\\\\{0,1\\},&amp;q=0\\land a=1,\\\\\\{q+1\\},&amp;1\\le q&lt;n,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;q=n,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq(\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\Sigma,\\delta_n,0,\\{n\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_n(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\},&amp;q=0\\land a=0,\\\\\\{0,1\\},&amp;q=0\\land a=1,\\\\\\{q+1\\},&amp;1\\le q&lt;n,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;q=n,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq(\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\Sigma,\\delta_n,0,\\{n\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\;(|w|=j+n\\land w(j)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\;(|w|=j+n\\land w(j)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>状态 0 猜测一个 1 是倒数第 n 位，随后恰读 n−1 个字符。q=0 的分支与最后状态分支在 n≥1 下不重叠；n=1 也被覆盖。</p>\n<p>词位置先由 j∈dom(w) 限定，再要求 |w|=j+n；长度不足 n 的词没有见证，不会在公式中读取越域的位置。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"5abb4703af79a510","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_n(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\},&q=0\\land a=0,\\\\\\{0,1\\},&q=0\\land a=1,\\\\\\{q+1\\},&1\\le q<n,\\\\\\varnothing,&q=n,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq(\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\Sigma,\\delta_n,0,\\{n\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"W_n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\;(|w|=j+n\\land w(j)=1)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1440,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa|倒数第 n 位为 1 的小 NFA]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"602df1b3cfe65cc9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$N_n,W_n$ 见 [[73-df-nth-from-end-nfa]]；$M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\{0,1\\}}$。"}],"outgoing":["5abb4703af79a510","0a6da8c909717780"]}